  "normalized_markdown": "# FE-RISK_Executive_Board_Deck_v1.0_FINAL\n\n## Slide 1: Slide 1\n\nCOORDIN8 EXECUTIVE STRATEGY  \u2022  FINEDGE AI - AUTOMATED CREDIT UNDERWRITING  \u2022  FINAL APPROVED (STAGE 3)\n\nFE-RISK Strategic Intelligence & Executive Briefing\n\nFinal Sign-off and Production Deployment Presentation for FinEdge Capital Partners\n\nClient: FinEdge Capital Partners   |   Date: September 29, 2026   |   Status: Final Approved (Stage 3)\n\n## Slide 2: Slide 2\n\nStrategic Outcomes & Value Delivered\n\nEXECUTIVE BRIEFING\n\nCycle Time Reduction\n\n-88%\n\nReduced underwriting turnaround from 14 days to sub-second real-time scoring.\n\n\u2022 Instant customer feedback\n\n\u2022 Zero manual data re-entry\n\nRisk Accuracy\n\n0.914\n\nTop-decile model discriminative power under simulated macroeconomic stress.\n\n\u2022 Robust against rate shocks\n\n\u2022 SHAP explainability live\n\nCompliance Readiness\n\nFull compliance achieved across federal and industry regulatory frameworks.\n\n\u2022 ECOA Fair Lending certified\n\n\u2022 21 CFR Part 11 compliant\n\nCoordin8 Delivery System  \u2022  Confidential for FinEdge Capital Partners  \u2022  Final Approved (Stage 3)\n\n## Slide 3: Slide 3\n\nDeployment Architecture & Production Roadmap\n\nSYSTEM OPERATIONS\n\nPhase 1: Pilot Launch\n\nCommencing dark-launch traffic shadowing across 25% of live transactions.\n\n\u2022 Real-time parallel scoring\n\n\u2022 Zero customer impact\n\nPhase 2: Full Cutover\n\nPromote automated underwriting engine to primary decision authority.\n\n\u2022 Automated adverse notices\n\n\u2022 Continuous drift monitoring\n\nPhase 3: Scale\n\nExtend framework to enterprise international multi-region jurisdictions.\n\n\u2022 Multi-currency support\n\n\u2022 Local compliance adaptors\n\nCoordin8 Delivery System  \u2022  Confidential for FinEdge Capital Partners  \u2022  Final Approved (Stage 3)\n",
